{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/types.ts#L70","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/query-core/src/types.ts:70"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The interface to augment via declaration merging to override Query's default types repository-wide.\nEach field it declares replaces the default of the matching type: "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"defaultError"},{"type":"text","value":" for "},{"type":"link","href":"../type-aliases/DefaultError.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"DefaultError"}]},{"type":"text","value":",\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"queryKey"},{"type":"text","value":" for "},{"type":"link","href":"../type-aliases/QueryKey.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"QueryKey"}]},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"mutationKey"},{"type":"text","value":" for "},{"type":"link","href":"../type-aliases/MutationKey.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"MutationKey"}]},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"queryMeta"},{"type":"text","value":" for "},{"type":"link","href":"../type-aliases/QueryMeta.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"QueryMeta"}]},{"type":"text","value":" and\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"mutationMeta"},{"type":"text","value":" for "},{"type":"link","href":"../type-aliases/MutationMeta.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"MutationMeta"}]},{"type":"text","value":". Leave a field out to keep that type's default.\nAugment the module you install — "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/react-query"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/vue-query"},{"type":"text","value":",\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/solid-query"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/svelte-query"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/preact-query"},{"type":"text","value":",\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/angular-query-experimental"},{"type":"text","value":" or "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/lit-query"},{"type":"text","value":". Augmenting "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/query-core"},{"type":"text","value":"\nworks too and covers every adapter at once."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"// Use the module you installed — here, the React adapter.\ndeclare module '@tanstack/react-query' {\n  interface Register {\n    defaultError: AxiosError\n  }\n}","lang":"ts"}],"headings":[{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nDefined in: [packages/query-core/src/types.ts:70](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/types.ts#L70)\n\nThe interface to augment via declaration merging to override Query's default types repository-wide.\nEach field it declares replaces the default of the matching type: `defaultError` for [DefaultError](../type-aliases/DefaultError.md),\n`queryKey` for [QueryKey](../type-aliases/QueryKey.md), `mutationKey` for [MutationKey](../type-aliases/MutationKey.md), `queryMeta` for [QueryMeta](../type-aliases/QueryMeta.md) and\n`mutationMeta` for [MutationMeta](../type-aliases/MutationMeta.md). Leave a field out to keep that type's default.\nAugment the module you install — `@tanstack/react-query`, `@tanstack/vue-query`,\n`@tanstack/solid-query`, `@tanstack/svelte-query`, `@tanstack/preact-query`,\n`@tanstack/angular-query-experimental` or `@tanstack/lit-query`. Augmenting `@tanstack/query-core`\nworks too and covers every adapter at once.\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\n// Use the module you installed — here, the React adapter.\ndeclare module '@tanstack/react-query' {\n  interface Register {\n    defaultError: AxiosError\n  }\n}\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: Register\ntitle: Register\n---\n\nDefined in: [packages/query-core/src/types.ts:70](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/types.ts#L70)\n\nThe interface to augment via declaration merging to override Query's default types repository-wide.\nEach field it declares replaces the default of the matching type: `defaultError` for [DefaultError](../type-aliases/DefaultError.md),\n`queryKey` for [QueryKey](../type-aliases/QueryKey.md), `mutationKey` for [MutationKey](../type-aliases/MutationKey.md), `queryMeta` for [QueryMeta](../type-aliases/QueryMeta.md) and\n`mutationMeta` for [MutationMeta](../type-aliases/MutationMeta.md). Leave a field out to keep that type's default.\nAugment the module you install — `@tanstack/react-query`, `@tanstack/vue-query`,\n`@tanstack/solid-query`, `@tanstack/svelte-query`, `@tanstack/preact-query`,\n`@tanstack/angular-query-experimental` or `@tanstack/lit-query`. Augmenting `@tanstack/query-core`\nworks too and covers every adapter at once.\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\n// Use the module you installed — here, the React adapter.\ndeclare module '@tanstack/react-query' {\n  interface Register {\n    defaultError: AxiosError\n  }\n}\n```\n"}
